export const content = "<p><!--Continuation of previous post <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-tokyo-sensoji-temple-meiji-shrine-tsukiji-market-ueno-park-shinjuku-shibuya/\">Things to do in Tokyo, Japan</a>--></p>\n<p>We just arrived in Osaka City.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-869\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_153345_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>On our way to our accommodation first to leave our luggages and rest first.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-873\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_155203_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>On our way to our place, we need to transfer stations and on the way to the other station we passed by this street mall where there are several restos and stalls selling different kinds of things.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-874\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_161203_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Route map of Osaka. Looks complicated ay? at first yeah. but you just have to look for the train station and what line you need to get to and that will probably be fine.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-875\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_164142_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Our accommodation. We booked in AirBNB. I suggest you book at AirBNB as well since they are very popular for accommodation in Japan. Very cheap and more convenient as per my experience comparing to staying at hotels. Please visit <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/where-to-stay-in-japan-tokyo-osaka-kyoto-fukuoka/\">Where to stay in Fukuoka, Osaka &amp; Tokyo, Japan</a> for guides &amp; tips getting accommodation</p>\n<p>Our host jsut gave us instructions on how to get to the apartment and it&#8217;s key.</p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-876 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_165743_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"airbnb osaka japan\" width=\"557\" height=\"990\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-877 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_165757_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"airbnb osaka japan\" width=\"569\" height=\"1012\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-878\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_165823_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"airbnb osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Our toilet &amp; shower were clean and nice. However using the shower is a bit annoying for it takes several minutes for the water to heat up then it gets cold again. I talked to the host about this issue but unfortunately, it was not resolved during our stay.</p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-879 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_165840_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"487\" height=\"866\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-880 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_165849_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka japan\" width=\"485\" height=\"862\" /></p>\n<p>We just rested for few minutes then we were on our way to Dotonbori to eat and explore!</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-881\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_181120_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-887\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_182914_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" />    <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-891\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183249_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-892\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_183533_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" />    <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-896\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_184731_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" />           <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-907\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_190308_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"dotonbori food osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" />    <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-911\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160417_190937_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20160417_190937_HDR\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>We wonder around Dotonbori and eat whatever food we see that looks good!<br />\nKindly visit <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/osaka-dotonbori-non-stop-eating/\">Eat til you drop in Dotonbori, Osaka, Japan</a> for more details on things we did in Dotonbori.</p>\n<p>Afterwards, we just went home and rest to be ready for the next day..</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Day 2</strong></p>\n<p>We grab a bite first in the shopping mall on our way to the train station.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_940\" style=\"width: 614px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-940\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_112145_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"food soba noodles osaka japan\" width=\"614\" height=\"1092\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Cold soba noodles and a dipping sauce</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-942 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_114827_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"food soba noodles osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>We can&#8217;t resist these good looking bread.. very good indeed!</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-943\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_115931_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"bread osaka japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>We are on our way to Osaka Station..</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-944\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_120451_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka station train japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Getting to Osaka Castle &#8211; From the station there are instructions and signs on how to go there. just follow it.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-947\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_124105_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>It might take you around 20mins of walking to go on top.. don&#8217;t worry, it&#8217;s a good exercise!</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-953\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_130234_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_961\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-961 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_131110_HDR-1.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Closer look of Osaka Castle</figcaption></figure>\n<p>This time capsule is pretty interesting, I wonder what happens when they open it years later?</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_964\" style=\"width: 405px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-964 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_131335_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan time capsule\" width=\"405\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Time Capsule</figcaption></figure>\n<p>There were several food stalls outside Osaka Castle for people who got hungry walking towards there. We did and we got Takoyaki. Yum!</p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-968 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_132635_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan takoyaki\" width=\"550\" height=\"978\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-969 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_132720_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan takoyaki\" width=\"567\" height=\"1008\" /></p>\n<p>Saw some Cherry Blossoms on the way back to train station from Osaka Castle. Soooooo beautiful!</p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-966 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_131813_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan cherry blossoms\" width=\"560\" height=\"996\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-972 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_133913_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan cherry blossoms\" width=\"571\" height=\"1015\" />   <img class=\"wp-image-975 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_133951_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"cherry blossoms osaka castle japan\" width=\"790\" height=\"445\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-976 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_134004_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan cherry blossoms osaka castle japan\" width=\"791\" height=\"445\" /></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_983\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-983 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_135237_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan train\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Some of the trains her has designs..</figcaption></figure>\n<p>After Osaka Castle, we had bread and coffee in the mall beside Osaka train station before going home.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-985 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_142720_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka castle japan bread coffee train station\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>After resting, I decided to go out again. My mother was pretty tired and didn&#8217;t bother to come with me.</p>\n<p>Osaka Shinsekai is close to our accommodation. Maybe around 20min walk? It was already night time when I got there and most of the shops were already closed. but restos were still open. Time to get some foooood.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_986\" style=\"width: 1279px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-986 size-full\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_203459_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Osaka Shinsekai</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-989\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_204735_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>I&#8217;m wondering around this area and looking for a place to eat.. mmmm..</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-990\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_205722_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>This resto has a lot of people eating inside so I&#8217;m assuming it&#8217;s good. Haha</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-988\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_204636_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>Watched this guy make the fresh sushi in front of me. I was already drooling just watching him prepare it.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-996 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_211143_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"610\" height=\"1084\" /></p>\n<p>Look at thaaaat! Uni, Salmon Roe, Scallops, Salmon &amp; Crab. What can go wrong with these???</p>\n<p>I swear this is one of the best sushi I&#8217;ve eaten! I enjoyed every bite of it. <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-995\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_211133_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"1279\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p>To cap off the night, I bought a beer and drank it on my way home. (yeah it&#8217;s allowed haha)</p>\n<p><img class=\" wp-image-999 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/IMG_20160418_232145.jpg\" alt=\"osaka shinsekai japan sushi food\" width=\"431\" height=\"766\" /></p>\n<p>I went to Kyoto the next day. To read visit <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-kyoto-golden-temple-bamboo-forest-fushimi-inari-shrine/\">Things to do in Kyoto, Japan</a></p>\n<p><strong>Other related blogs in Japan</strong><br />\nItineraries:<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-osaka-dotonbori-osaka-castle-shinsekai/\"><br />\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-tokyo-sensoji-temple-meiji-shrine-tsukiji-market-ueno-park-shinjuku-shibuya/\">Things to do in Tokyo, Japan</a> <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/itinerary-in-kyoto-golden-temple-bamboo-forest-fushimi-inari-shrine/\"><br />\n</a><a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/things-to-do-in-fukuoka-japan-nanzoin-temple-yatai-ippudo/\">Things to do in Fukuoka, Japan</a></p>\n<p>Food:<br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/best-tonkotsu-ramen-fukuoka-japan-yatai-ippudo-ramen-street/\">Where to get ramen in Fukuoka, Japan</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/osaka-dotonbori-non-stop-eating/\">Eat til you drop in Dotonbori, Osaka, Japan</a></p>\n<p>Accommodation:<br />\n<a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/where-to-stay-in-japan-tokyo-osaka-kyoto-fukuoka/\">Where to stay in Fukuoka, Osaka &amp; Tokyo, Japan</a></p>\n"
